---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 38
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Producer as Authenticated flow producer
    participant API as Ingestion API
    participant DB as Jobs and data store
    participant Worker as Ingestion worker
    participant Models as Verified model cascade
    participant Publisher as Outbox publisher
    actor UI as Dashboard

    Producer->>API: Submit flow batch
    activate API
    API->>API: Validate complete request
    alt request rejected
        API-->>Producer: 4xx response, nothing enqueued
    else request accepted
        API->>DB: Enqueue new event IDs atomically
        DB-->>API: Accepted and duplicate dispositions
        API-->>Producer: 202 Accepted
    end
    deactivate API

    loop each eligible job
        Worker->>DB: Claim job with processing lease
        DB-->>Worker: Canonical observation
        Worker->>Models: Run compatible model cascade
        Models-->>Worker: Prediction and optional alert
        alt processing succeeds
            Worker->>DB: Commit result, success transition,<br/>and outbox events atomically
        else processing fails
            Worker->>DB: Commit retry or dead-letter state
        end
    end

    loop each committed outbox event
        Publisher->>DB: Claim unpublished event
        DB-->>Publisher: Event payload
        Publisher-)UI: WebSocket prediction or alert
        Publisher->>DB: Mark published or schedule retry
    end
